index 00000000000..4e5fee3b777
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/changes/dev/14358.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fix bug where Artemis123 axial gradiometers were treated as magnetometers when building SSS external bases, which made the head position estimated by :func:`mne.io.read_raw_artemis123` (``add_head_trans=True``) noisier, by `Eric Larson`_.
